    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/4e95c0921eb4c257d76aa835a7361202.avif?t=1724978554\" /></div><br><br>Glen is summoned from a different world to save Gaia from the Destiny, The dark lord of creations and destructions. <br><br>In this world, All the combat laws act differently from other worlds.<br>All the actions included Dash are cards. <br>When activated a card, the card will be placed randomly on the ground.<br>If you pick them up the cards on the ground, you can activate them again.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/82be919c9ad8d6c2c5172efeffa1e1c9.poster.avif?t=1724978554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/82be919c9ad8d6c2c5172efeffa1e1c9.webm?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/82be919c9ad8d6c2c5172efeffa1e1c9.mp4?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Trial Of Destiny is a fast-paced action RPG + rogue-like + card game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">key Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Epic anime battle<br></li><li> Unique action RPG and card game mechanic<br></li><li> Deck building<br></li><li> Bullet hell<br></li><li> Game-breaking power up<br></li><li> OP Bosses</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/b8fb540571442c2c1ef541d54ce11ea9.poster.avif?t=1724978554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/b8fb540571442c2c1ef541d54ce11ea9.webm?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/b8fb540571442c2c1ef541d54ce11ea9.mp4?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ultimate card</h2>The ultimate cards are powerful card that can be activated only when your mana is fully charged.<br>Whenever you pick up a card, your mana will be charged.<br>The ultimate card is the only card that will NOT drop from your hand.<br><br>Dash, Dodge the enemy's attacks, collect the cards and unleash the ultimate power.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/f55f32cbea9055fd15ac6f185bc90830.poster.avif?t=1724978554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/f55f32cbea9055fd15ac6f185bc90830.webm?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/f55f32cbea9055fd15ac6f185bc90830.mp4?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trial Of Destiny Is Right Now Under Development</h2>For more update and discussion Please join the discord, Follow us on Facebook and Twitter.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/4e95c0921eb4c257d76aa835a7361202.avif?t=1724978554\" /></div><br><br>Glen is summoned from a different world to save Gaia from the Destiny, The dark lord of creations and destructions. <br><br>In this world, All the combat laws act differently from other worlds.<br>All the actions included Dash are cards. <br>When activated a card, the card will be placed randomly on the ground.<br>If you pick them up the cards on the ground, you can activate them again.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/82be919c9ad8d6c2c5172efeffa1e1c9.poster.avif?t=1724978554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/82be919c9ad8d6c2c5172efeffa1e1c9.webm?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/82be919c9ad8d6c2c5172efeffa1e1c9.mp4?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Trial Of Destiny is a fast-paced action RPG + rogue-like + card game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">key Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Epic anime battle<br></li><li> Unique action RPG and card game mechanic<br></li><li> Deck building<br></li><li> Bullet hell<br></li><li> Game-breaking power up<br></li><li> OP Bosses</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/b8fb540571442c2c1ef541d54ce11ea9.poster.avif?t=1724978554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141860/extras/b8fb540571442c2c1ef541d54ce11ea9.webm?t=1724978554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc